"""
All-in-One Multi-Platform Social Collector

Single source file containing the complete YouTube, Instagram, and TikTok
collectors plus the master rotation scheduler/GUI. Each platform retains its
own SQLite database and all original collection/enrichment/persistence logic.

Platform databases:
  - youtube_maximum.db
  - instagram.db
  - tiktok.db

