   information, and YouTube comments. V38 runs comments through an independent
   official-API lane so slow yt-dlp enrichment does not block comment collection.
7. One bad channel/video never terminates the whole run.

This does not download media and does not bypass DRM, CAPTCHAs, PO Tokens,
paid access, or other access controls. YouTube's internal APIs are undocumented
and can change, so raw responses are intentionally retained.

