# V14 DURABLE CHECKPOINT + PLATFORM ACCESS + HOT-PATH OPTIMIZATION
# ============================================================================
# Goals:
#   * never treat record existence or last_enriched_at alone as proof of
#     completion; resumability is stage/state based
#   * distinguish Instagram endpoint refusal (notably 401/"Please wait") from
#     genuine platform throttling; attempt each resolver endpoint at most once
#   * keep TikTok throttle detection strict: only explicit 429/rate/challenge
#     evidence can park the platform
#   * reuse cached account identities, direct HTTP connection pools, and
#     persisted raw payloads
#   * batch Instagram comment/raw writes into transactions
#   * use stronger SQLite tuning without weakening checkpoint durability
#   * preserve bounded YouTube concurrency and do not use async I/O around the
#     stateful yt-dlp/Instaloader clients

