# ===========================================================================
# V33 — Meta Graph throttle cooldown + non-professional fast-skip
# ===========================================================================
# Meta OAuth error code 4 (Application request limit reached) is a platform/app
# throttle, not an account-resolution failure. Persist the existing Instagram
# access cooldown and immediately yield the Instagram worker to the scheduler so
# it does not burn through every configured username while throttled.
# Meta error 110 / subcode 2207013 (Cannot find User) is account-specific for
# Business Discovery: skip that username and continue to the next account.
