# Scheduler lifecycle ownership.
# V28 already isolates child processes, but V34 makes the ownership rule
# enforceable: dedicated-server runs are always continuous and the only code
# path allowed to set global Force Stop is the explicit GUI Force Stop button.
# A normal worker COMPLETE merely schedules that platform's next pass.
