# V42 — TRI-PLATFORM EVIDENCE VISIBILITY + STRICT COMPLETENESS
# ===========================================================================
# Goals:
#   * expose catalog progress separately from durable database completion for
#     YouTube, Instagram and TikTok;
#   * never equate a status string with persisted evidence;
#   * require a versioned full-catalog proof before Instagram/TikTok can use
#     their recent-window history shortcut;
#   * keep every incomplete row in the durable DB backlog after restart;
#   * make comment terminal states evidence-based and visible;
#   * fix TikTok empty-format and comment-refresh status bugs;
#   * fully paginate Instagram Graph and TikTok Research comments, including
#     reply pages, and never convert API failure/stop into SUCCESS_EMPTY.

