# Production goal: the three SQLite databases on this Windows server are the
# authoritative store.  V46 removes avoidable database overhead from the hot
# path, keeps WAL bounded without checkpointing every few seconds, makes the GUI
# sample evidence off-thread, prevents cloud DATABASE_URL values from silently
# changing the backend, and provides verified local migration/backup utilities.
