# ===========================================================================
# V54 correctly reopened COMPLETE_LIMITED rows when curl_cffi became available,
# but the inherited V51 startup reconciliation immediately re-finalized those
# same rows and moved access_retry_after seven days into the future again. That
# made the recovery pass appear to run while the old records were still SKIP.
# V55 makes COMPLETE_LIMITED reconciliation idempotent, performs a new one-time
# access recovery, falls back to the latest actual run inputs when the editable
# social_universe.csv cannot be parsed, and treats a repeatedly unresolvable
# public profile as an explicit access-limited universe member rather than an
# endless generic NOT FINISHED state.
